              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ola nakaia kimusi mnyangonyi naawuyakongoda, ngera mndungi wasikira lwaka lwapo na kurughua mnyango, nichangia andenyi kwake na kuja andwamweri nao, nao uchaja andwamweri nani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
